    {
      "id": "claim_9647c64578624f7ca9bbbd0d46a0ead6",
      "statement": "The container healthcheck polls `GET /health` every 15s (not `/health/model`), and the compose worker service disables its healthcheck entirely, which is why `/health/model` costs a provider call and must be wired into readiness checks with the cache in mind.",
