      "statement": "`tests/test_model_status.py` drives the probe through an `httpx.MockTransport` installed by monkeypatching `model_status._make_client`, so the cache/`force` behavior, credential redaction, `unsupported` providers, per-provider probe paths and the base-URL diagnostics are all asserted without a real provider.",
