    {
      "id": "claim_5fbaeab46e1a43069d66370e2c31578b",
      "statement": "Neither health endpoint declares a Pydantic response model: `health()` returns a plain dict and `health_model()` returns a hand-built `JSONResponse`, so the JSON shapes documented for `/health` and `/health/model` are the de facto contract (they appear as free-form objects in OpenAPI) and `app/schemas.py` holds no health-related model.",
